<title>BELARUS: Belarus rouble unchanged at 15,150 in Minsk.</title>
<headline>Belarus rouble unchanged at 15,150 in Minsk.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belarussian rouble was unchanged at  15,150 per dollar on the Minsk Interbank Currency Exchange.</p>
<p>				    November 19	 November 18</p>
<p> Rate to dollar		    15,150		15,150</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $2.385 million	  $2.725 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
